{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/wishlist2.gif?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Story.png?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1752907838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1752907838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.mp4?t=1752907838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.poster.avif?t=1752907838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.webm?t=1752907838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.mp4?t=1752907838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a woman in her late 20's, struggling with the responsibility of balancing the intricacies of your relationships and your own mental stability, whilst also seeking the truth behind the mysterious death of your husband. You must navigate through a web of secrets involving a mysterious cult, personal traumas, and complex relationships.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Visual Novel/Otome Game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/characters.png?t=1752907838\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Boys.png?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 5 Male Leads you will meet over the course of the game. Each one them connected to you in someway or another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Haruki.png?t=1752907838\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/rYOTA.png?t=1752907838\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Ren.png?t=1752907838\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Kazuki.png?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Features.png?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various Storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings to Unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various CG's to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rhythm Mini Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://s