amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/0685c9c6a09e55dc5c55b17798485273fdd7c64d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752907838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\"Koibito no Nazo\" contains mature themes and content that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players should be aware of the following:\r\n\r\nViolence: The game includes depictions of physical violence, including murder and psychological manipulation.\r\n\r\nSelf-Harm and Suicide: The storyline involves themes of self-harm and suicide, including a character who dies under suspicious circumstances that appear as a suicide.\r\n\r\nMental Health Issues: Themes of depression, anxiety, and PTSD are present, as characters cope with traumatic experiences and their aftermath.\r\n\r\nPlayers who may be sensitive to these themes are advised to proceed with caution. Our aim is to handle these topics with care and respect while delivering a compelling and immersive experience."},"demos":[{"appid":3557290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/wishlist2.gif?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/Story.png?t=1752907838\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1752907838\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1752907838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai